Package: scConvertShiny
Type: Package
Title: Interactive Single-Cell Format Conversion Powered by 'scConvert'
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Yongchao", "Zhang", email = "zhangyongchao@nibs.ac.cn",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: A shinydashboard application for converting single-cell data
    between the formats supported by the 'scConvert' package: AnnData (h5ad),
    h5Seurat, MuData (h5mu), Loom, Zarr, TileDB-SOMA, SpatialData, RDS,
    SingleCellExperiment and Stereo-seq GEF. Small files can be uploaded from
    the browser while large files and directory-based formats are addressed by
    a local path. Conversions run asynchronously in a background process and
    the converted output, together with a conversion report, can be downloaded.
